  "articleBody": "Keeping your home in tip-top shape doesn’t have to be a mystery. It's really about being proactive and knowing what to look for! The key is a preventative schedule, which can save you from bigger, costlier headaches down the road. Start by regularly inspecting for leaks – those tiny drips under the sink or around windows can cause significant damage over time. Keep an eye out for pests too; early detection can prevent infestations. Don't forget to check your electrical outlets and switches for any signs of trouble, like flickering lights or warm plates. And of course, take a good look at your home's exterior for any signs of damage, especially after bad weather. A big one that's often overlooked is replacing or servicing filters for your HVAC system and testing your smoke and carbon monoxide detectors. These small tasks make a huge difference in your home's health and your family's safety. HH Remodeling LLC, serving the greater Denver area, can assist with many handyman services and repairs, helping you stay on top of these essential maintenance items. Don't wait for a problem to escalate; a little attention now goes a long way!",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
